	// entry at another plugin's slot would have its aux bytes read under a
	// layout that does not describe them.
	//
	// The two headend arrays are separate PROG_ARRAYs that share the slot
	// range, so a grant of v4 slot 16 must not imply v6 slot 16: a plugin
